      "observation": "Initial 58-test run had one fixture failure: explicit survivor ID 90 caused fresh implicit operands to receive 91/92, so the fixture tombstone 00091 aliased a selected operand. The production source proof correctly refused Del. The fixture now uses explicit operand IDs 1/2, proves tombstone 91 is unused, checks binding/native/public IDs from the same save and retains an intentional selected-ID alias refusal. No production safeguard was relaxed."
