  "limitations": [
    "All 204 M3 children and the milestone remain unaccepted. No integration, push, publication, merge or release permission is granted.",
    "Boolean operations retain the bounded safe operand policy. Text/data/fields/images/control/ports/inherited masters/styles/authored behavior/glue or incoming semantic references are refused. Combine, Fragment, Trim and exact-build appearance/order/selection semantics remain open. A single Core Graphics call is not interruptible.",
    "PNG crop bounds are conservative publication geometry, not pixel-tight ink bounds or exact-build visual parity. One object/scene setup can exceed a main-pass time target. Existing 100-million-pixel, 100000-dimension and 128 MiB retained-record caps remain; they are not a total-RSS bound.",
    "Selection includes group-owned edges, not every connector between ordinary selected nodes. Unselected endpoint/obstacle nodes participate in routing but are not painted. Selection drafts refuse changed raw selection even without a document revision; later edits after submission do not replace the captured export snapshot.",
    "Independent container/list relationships, automatic pinned-library loading and remaining M3 production contracts are still open at this source commit. Exact-build licensed Visio/COM, bidirectional no-repair open/edit/save, same-font regional and calibrated physical-printer acceptance remain absent. Prerequisite skips are not passes; the M2 release performance exception does not qualify M3."
  ],
